Description: Attaches run-time type contracts to R functions. A function is
    annotated with a type declaration written in the 'tastr' type language;
    contractr injects assertions that check the arguments and the return value
    against the declared type on every call, signalling a warning or an error
    (depending on the configured severity) when a value does not conform.
